{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-41","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, and the rectangle contained by them medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational; and let it be called the side of the sum of two medial areas.","book":10,"number":41,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.41","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.41/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":41,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","contentId":"euclid-10-41","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"554a451f4e6f7186672b25b1fbb2f1639950c2ef9584288731e0baf723c64871","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-41.statement","euclid-10-41.construction.1","euclid-10-41.construction.2","euclid-10-41.proof.1","euclid-10-41.proof.2","euclid-10-41.proof.3","euclid-10-41.proof.4","euclid-10-41.proof.5","euclid-10-41.proof.6","euclid-10-41.proof.7","euclid-10-41.proof.8","euclid-10-41.proof.9","euclid-10-41.construction.3","euclid-10-41.construction.4","euclid-10-41.proof.10","euclid-10-41.proof.11","euclid-10-41.proof.12","euclid-10-41.proof.13","euclid-10-41.conclusion","euclid-10-41.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-41.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e79d0a08fc50121c334b93fb79e059d98fe0c4b099ea584a623a1e2fca65b1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, and the rectangle contained by them medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational; and let it be called the side of the sum of two medial areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将正方形的正方形直线和中项无理线段和不可公度的矩形直线加在一起,整个直线为无理,并称之为两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9452cbddf76154a0612f01eebae50f7b894ab41acd85b621dd3368715d8f3730","citations":["euclid-10-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two straight lines AB, BC incommensurable in square and satisfying the given conditions [[X. 35](/principles/euclid-10-35) ] be added together; I say that AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将第AB、BC、不可公度直线加在一起,满足特定条件;我说,AC是无理。 [ [X. 35](/principles/euclid-10-35)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5213efab4bc8aa8628152f0b67196cfe9296fcb8f87fb9d11d9e74cccba139bd","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line DE be set out, and let there be applied to DE the rectangle DF equal to the squares on AB, BC, and the rectangle GH equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC; therefore the whole DH is equal to the square on AC. [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 DE, 并适用于DE, 矩形 DF, 等于正方形, AB, BC, 矩形, 和矩形 GH, 等于 矩形 AB, AB, BC; 因此,整个DH等于 正方形, 等于 AC [ [II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"552a2cc99d982632c0253944d5c1d49ff13ba247a93a40339d6b4fae7f79e805","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the sum of the squares on AB, BC is medial, and is equal to DF, therefore DF is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AB比正方形,BC等于中项无理线段,等于DF,因此DF也等于中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b8ffa002a95db7b8316140eed9565d8f24a4d4874039b900706eeb35d5a17d3","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore DG is rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,DG为有理和不可公度为DE [ [X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba3aa3b5daab8d182b4fc73e23fa673a2d988830a583f5d776b0e6f87e18ada1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason GK is also rational and incommensurable in length with GF, that is, DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,GK的长度为有理和不可公度,GF,即DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1011a08a99a26972688518d9976aadda9ed74b0c48b045613ed41180222d04b3","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AB, BC are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC, DF is incommensurable with GH; so that DG is also incommensurable with GK. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) , [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自AB正方形起,BC起为不可公度起,矩形起为AB起的两倍,BC起为DF起,AB起为GH起;所以DG也是不可公度和GK。[ 音 ] [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84d4dd1847f4632ca51b620da2d6936d22e097ec575f1ac3f8a8890a7af83b6c","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore DG, GK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DK is irrational and what is called binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,DG,GK,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,DK,无理,二项无理线段 [ [X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7677d8cbf786282e5f53fbd9b449a74931b8833a5fa56249a4b90a7100b84116","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DE is rational; therefore DH is irrational, and the side of the square which is equal to it is irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DE是有理,DH是无理,正方形的一方等于无理 [ [X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0d1ee327d5cb67a017964794ed4cb26ba1d07e7c0002b6af936e19c60e35f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AC is the side of the square equal to HD; therefore AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC是正方形等于HD的一面,因此AC是无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc071f1028680db9a044b05218efc72d2b3783a47d455685b7b12281958a1b1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called the side of the sum of two medial areas. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把它称为两个中项无理线段地区之和的一面 Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37d48a809d22a12e5924c2ddb734dd98c17e10cc87c8a27d117225f2750d00d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. And that the aforesaid irrational straight lines are divided only in one way into the straight lines of which they are the sum and which produce the types in question, we will now prove after premising the following lemma."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理,上述无理线段只以一种方式划分为直线,它们就是直线的总和,并且扩大了所涉类型,我们现在将在准备下列列姆马之后证明这一点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":12,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a199c8c9d7ced00da878ff99bec337b72961a72a7e9717eafb84bd87d9afe52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the straight line AB be set out, let the whole be cut into unequal parts at each of the points C, D, and let AC be supposed greater than DB; I say that the squares on AC, CB are greater than the squares on AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"纵横线AB,将所有部分分为C,D,AC,AC,DB,AB;我说,AC,CB,正方形,AD,DB,正方形,正方形,AB,AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d181cd43368a266d2dc2ec644be5cb2fb5dcaf6bb171c57319d72a2e649f1d4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB be bisected at E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB在E上被拆分"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6df7dbefe3c3058624f4d075b19d991d43dec1265b0e3592ef3c839b378622ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AC is greater than DB, let DC be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder AD is greater than the remainder CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,由于AC大于DB,各减去DC;因此,其余AD大于其余CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ca647225106772e4c860f9e232dc55bff8d7aac03c55b55d99a65dc329ce00b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is equal to EB; therefore DE is less than EC; therefore the points C, D are not equidistant from the point of bisection."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE等于EB;因此,DE小于EC;因此,C、D点从两点来看并不相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9ddf0a1d48744f3a5961f9168ceca144b36e240fdaade83996af45319b3cde1","citations":["euclid-2-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AC, CB together with the square on EC is equal to the square on EB, [[II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5) ] and, further, the rectangle AD, DB together with the square on DE is equal to the square on EB, [id.] therefore the rectangle AC, CB together with the square on EC is equal to the rectangle AD, DB together with the square on DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AC,CB和EC的正方形等于EB,矩形 AD,DB和正方形等于DE,[同上]因此矩形 AC,CB和EC的正方形等于矩形 AD,DB和正方形。 [ [II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0c0a20c245e0b463da9613ba6f369cc85e4d02a28b51c93154d89afd6082604","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And of these the square on DE is less than the square on EC; therefore the remainder, the rectangle AC, CB, is also less than the rectangle AD, DB, so that twice the rectangle AC, CB is also less than twice the rectangle AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其中DE分的正方形分还不到EC分的正方形分,因此其余的矩形分AC分CB分也低于矩形分AD分DB分,因此矩形分AC分的两倍也低于矩形分AD分DB分的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fff7890b2d8fe79199d2c6daa85e62d5f8f677e3b60c58bb8acf27ef145e64e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also the remainder, the sum of the squares on AC, CB, is greater than the sum of the squares on AD, DB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的AC和CB的正方形和AD的正方形和DB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-41.source","contentId":"euclid-10-41","revisionId":"euclid-10-41@raw-554a451f4e6f7186","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e98ee2034a4fb64a98b315758412ef2e517f274152965e5e8bac2a0e1cf37f54","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.41/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.41\nCorpus SH